---

<div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-space-md">
  <div
    class="rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-space-lg"
  >
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
      <div class="flex flex-col">
        <span
          class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant uppercase font-semibold"
          >Consumo del Periodo</span
        >
        <span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface"
          >Límites y Agentes</span
        >
      </div>
      <span
        class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary"
      >
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">donut_large</span>
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
      <div
        class="flex justify-between items-center font-label-md text-label-md"
      >
        <span class="text-on-surface">Agentes Bot en Producción</span>
        <span class="text-primary font-bold">5 de 5 (100%)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full h-2 rounded-full bg-surface-container overflow-hidden">
        <div class="h-full bg-primary-container rounded-full w-full"></div>
      </div>
      <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"
        >Capacidad máxima del plan actual alcanzada.</span
      >
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
      <div
        class="flex justify-between items-center font-label-md text-label-md"
      >
        <span class="text-on-surface">Mensajes Procesados este Mes</span>
        <span class="text-on-surface font-semibold"
          >12,450 / <span class="text-primary font-bold">Ilimitados</span></span
        >
      </div>
      <div class="w-full h-2 rounded-full bg-surface-container overflow-hidden">
        <div class="h-full bg-secondary rounded-full w-3/4"></div>
      </div>
      <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"
        >Incluye respuestas de IA generativa y catálogo interactivo.</span
      >
    </div>

    <div
      class="p-space-md rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low flex items-center justify-between"
    >
      <div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm">
        <div
          class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">phone_iphone</span
          >
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface"
            >+34 600 000 000</span
          >
          <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant"
            >Conexión Meta Cloud API</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>
      <span
        class="px-space-xs py-0.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm font-medium"
        >1 Conexión</span
      >
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    class="rounded-xl bg-tertiary-fixed/30 p-space-md flex items-center gap-space-md shadow-sm"
  >
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[22px]"
      >lightbulb</span
    >
    <p
      class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-tertiary-fixed-variant leading-snug"
    >
      ¿Necesitas añadir otro restaurante o franquicia? Con el <strong
        >Plan Enterprise</strong
      > puedes unificar hasta 10 números en una sola cuenta maestra.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
